{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788233936264130181,"compiled_state":{"alias":"avoided-flannel-eeve","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"b34aa3033a84d110b9e86d6c24e94bd3b36ffccda6c4dc92da8bfe8f1248f33a","event_uuid":"cd1ea4b1-91f0-4178-b5ef-272cd9b3c429","position":{"commit_sha":"93e45d03bc028bf4b20850ae984bf79c0d51f02a","position":"1788228927503392001-cd1ea4b1-91f0-4178-b5ef-272cd9b3c429"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"42da80e85291573ea140a4a15b91018ba0ce161d82d03c4b28caa262a9b0a820","event_uuid":"5ccd22ba-a668-470c-9089-01a9710d3b38","position":{"commit_sha":"a0b3c23fb769e8b9e24afb7a495a7f72b9ca71e2","position":"1788228940971141001-5ccd22ba-a668-470c-9089-01a9710d3b38"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788228927503392001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"5ccd22ba-a668-470c-9089-01a9710d3b38","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"0a3b-4201-6528-4f30"}],"description":"## Problem\n\nOn 2026-08-31 (~17:30-18:00 PDT), three consecutive MCP log_session writes failed with: flock: could not acquire lock after 181s (holder: host=boot-bf4c34b1-475c-4363-8ff6-aada80c3c3ab pid=49003 start=19655570 held=155-174s pid_state=live op=compact-sweep).\n\n## Executed evidence (all captured during the incident)\n\n- ps -p 49003 returns nothing (rc=1) - the pid does not exist on this host.\n- lsof on /Users/joeoakhart/rebar/.tickets-tracker/.ticket-write.lock shows NO holder (rc=1); the file is the 0-byte flock target.\n- held values across the three attempts were non-monotonic (158s, 155s, 174s) while start stayed constant - consistent with a stale stamp being re-read, not a live re-acquiring sweep.\n- Discriminator: an immediate local-CLI write (rebar session-log append) from the main checkout succeeded instantly (log heinous-undivining-ungulate / 0a3b-4201-6528-4f30), proving the store lock itself was free.\n\n## Hypothesis (mechanism to confirm at RCA)\n\nThe MCP server's lock acquisition reads a holder stamp naming a dead pid and its liveness check judges it live (macOS pid-reuse or kill(pid,0) semantics; the larval-tribal-tigermoth class - stale lock unbounded without /proc), so every MCP write waits the full 181s and fails while the underlying flock is uncontended. Possibly interacting with the MCP server's own tracker path/clone rather than the shared checkout (the local CLI on the same store did not see the holder). The compact-sweep at pid 49003 exited without its stamp being cleared.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Root cause confirmed by reproduction: which lock/stamp the MCP server path reads, and why pid_state reported live for a dead pid.\n- [ ] A dead-holder stamp can no longer wedge MCP writes for the full timeout: liveness verification cannot return live for a nonexistent pid (or the stamp is advisory and the kernel flock is authoritative).\n- [ ] Regression test covering the dead-pid-stamp case on the MCP write path.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"5c48-90aa-8bd3-4ce1","ticket_type":"bug","title":"MCP server write path wedged: dead compact-sweep holder (pid 49003) reported pid_state=live, all writes time out at 181s","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["cd1ea4b1-91f0-4178-b5ef-272cd9b3c429","5ccd22ba-a668-470c-9089-01a9710d3b38"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788233936264130181,"uuid":"18a0ee33-c5d1-4d71-89d8-41e014406b83"}